    "speed": {
      "baseMoveSpeed": 165,
      "referenceSpeed": 70,
      "minMoveSpeed": 70,
      "maxMoveSpeed": 320,
      "attackSpeedShare": 0.3,
      "comment": "moveSpeed(px/s) = clamp(baseMoveSpeed * (SPD/referenceSpeed), minMoveSpeed, maxMoveSpeed); attackSpeedBonus = (SPD/referenceSpeed - 1) * attackSpeedShare, clamped [-0.35,0.45] in code. Produces a dramatic (~3.7x) speed spread across the roster (e.g. Machop 35 SPD -> ~82px/s, Jolteon 130 SPD -> ~306px/s) so slow/fast Pokemon feel clearly different, while attack-cooldown gets only a smaller secondary bonus so Speed is not an all-purpose stat."
    }
  },
